        "description": "Tipperary is a hyper-local mobile application that provides real-time, crowdsourced, and verified average tip percentages for every restaurant, cafe, and bar in your vicinity.",
        "key_features": [
          "Live Tip Averages: See the mean and median tip percentage for a specific venue.",
          "Contextual Insights: Understand if a venue is 'High-Tip' (fine dining) or 'Flat-Tip' (casual cafes).",
